            "id": 20,
            "title": "What is Adobe Photoshop",
            "body": "Adobe Photoshop ranks first among the most preferred professional graphic design programs of today. With the development of advertising and design logic in the world at a much faster pace every day, incredible improvements have been achieved in software. Adobe has managed to attract attention as one of the most winning and well-known companies in the world thanks to the work it has done in relation to graphic programs in a short period of time.\\r\\n\\r\\nOne of the most important factors in the fact that graphics are becoming more professional every year in the world can undoubtedly be described as the Adobe Photoshop program. You will be able to understand that it is a mathematically and structurally developed system within a few hours after using it. Now we want to inform you much more clearly about the system.\\r\\n\\r\\nWHAT IS ADOBE PHOTOSHOP?\\r\\nIt attracts attention as an advanced graphic design program prepared by Adobe, which offers the possibility of vector drawing, can perform photo manipulation operations, allows you to make ads and visual edits. One of the biggest factors in the development of information technologies today is the Photoshop program. The positive environment it has created towards web design technologies has become much more serious.\\r\\n\\r\\nOne of the active factors in the emergence of the concept of web artay face design is the Photoshop program. Many years ago, web designs were developed only in the form of tables, while today they are drawn primarily as images in the Photoshop program, and then poured into CSS coding and, if necessary, enter the software phase.",
