            "id": 44,
            "title": "What is Advertising? What Are the Benefits?",
            "body": "Advertising is the totality of written, visual and audio studies carried out in order to encourage people to voluntarily benefit from a product or service, to draw their attention to the product, service, brand. Advertising, which means convincing the target audience to use and try products from the brand, should have original content. In advertising studies, there are basic purposes such as directing consumers&#039; attention to the product, creating selectivity in visual and auditory perception. The advertisements that brands and organizations make to increase their sales charts should always be at a good level and should not harm the value of the brand or its sectoral image. It is possible to briefly answer the question of what is advertising in the form of attracting the attention of customers directly. The goal of advertising is always to achieve commercial success.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe characteristics of a quality advertisement are as follows;\\r\\n\\r\\nIt should be interesting and attractive.\\r\\nIt should surprise the target audience, attract their attention.\\r\\nIt should be unique and amazing.\\r\\nIt should activate the feelings and desires of the target audience.\\r\\nIt should encourage you to benefit from the product or service.\\r\\nIt should provide commercial reputation to the brand.\\r\\nIt should be oriented to the needs of customers.\\r\\n\\r\\nWHAT ARE THE BENEFITS OF ADVERTISING?\\r\\nAds can have features that contain different emotions, such as humorous, sensitive, cheerful, energetic, sad, and surprising. Every detail in the content of advertisements should reach the consumer. When consumers watch the current advertisement, they should be curious about the product, believe in the promised aspects about the product and want to try it. Although the goal of ads is always to increase sales, they often have side goals, such as placing the brand in the consumer&#039;s mind. The benefits that advertising will provide to brands are as follows;\\r\\n\\r\\nCommunication is established between the consumer and the brand with advertisements. Dec.\\r\\nThe consumer is reminded of the brand, the brand&#039;s innovations are transferred.\\r\\nIt increases the awareness of the brand and gives confidence to the consumer.\\r\\nIt increases the reliability of the brand and a reliable brand image is created in the minds of customers.\\r\\nIt raises sales figures.",
