            "id": 46,
            "title": "Why Is Web Mail So Popular?",
            "body": "<p>Web mail accounts do not require you to install e-mail application software such as Microsoft Outlook on your computer. With web mail, you can read, send, reply October, forward, organize your e-mails into folders and save attachments. The web mail service stores all your e-mails in its systems and provides you with a web page that you can use to access your e-mail account. Using your e-mail address and password, you can easily log in to your account from the web page of the web mail service. Why Should We Use Webmail? One of the biggest advantages of web mail is that you can access the platform from anywhere with almost any device that can connect to the Internet. Since you can&#39;t just carry your laptop with you to check your email, you can also check your webmail from your smartphone or on anyone&#39;s computer. All your emails will be stored on the providers&#39; servers until you choose to delete them. Web mail is a good option for those who don&#39;t check their email regularly, don&#39;t have a computer, or travel frequently. To use most web mail systems, you just need to go to the provider&#39;s website and then enter your username and password to access your account</p>\\r\\n",
