            "id": 47,
            "title": "What is PrestaShop?",
            "body": "PrestaShop is a free e-commerce software distributed with open source code. It is PHP-based software that was accepted in 2005 as a student project at a scientific school in France.Thanks to its popularity, the software has been translated into 30 different languages in a short time. PrestaShop uses the PHP software language and MySQL base. it was named the best open source e-commerce software of 2011 and has more than 5,000,000 global downloads.\\r\\n\\r\\n \\r\\n\\r\\nThe reason why PrestaShop is so preferred is that it is quick and easy to install and offers everything that is needed under one roof. PrestaShop does not require a high level of coding knowledge, which you can easily add with basic PHP, HTML and CSS knowledge. With the responsive theme option, you will get a friendly look with the product and you can easily have a professional e-commerce site.\\r\\n\\r\\n \\r\\n\\r\\nIn PrestaShop, it has a modular structure, which is very easy to use the Admin panel as the front panel. From the admin panel, you can create categories for products, place products, organize orders, manage orders and manage modules without much knowledge.",
